{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garden and a Goat places you out in the multiverse where you are needed most. Your robot-self is introduced to one of a series of ecosystems in peril. Study the surroundings, clean up the environment, and revive the soil and plants to start enticing the local wildlife to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garden and a Goat is a single player casual, animal collecting and gardening game. In each ecosystem you encounter you'll spend time cleaning up the garden, planting various ecosystem specific plants, and attracting animals to the revived ecosystem. As animals visit, you'll interact with them in various ways (petting them, offering treats you make, placing decorations they enjoy) to unlock them as garden residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/extras/5676f5a5049eab0ffb84acc75784bc20.avif?t=1752432594\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll use your tech consoles and drones to help the garden recover. You'll scan and harvest ecobit data currency to fuel the placement of more resident plants, animals, and decorations to accelerate the progress. Once the animals begin to take up residence again, you'll also be able to seek out secret challenges that may transform or attract exciting multiverse variant animals too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/extras/5d132ab201b857d361fbb1d83bbc9718.avif?t=1752432594\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you unlock a few crops to plant and harvest, a few recipes for new treats to make at the treat console, and new decorations to both beautify your garden and further entice more animals to stay. You'll also unlock and be rewarded with cosmetic items to transform your robot, consoles, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh\u2026 and there's a goat!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3156550?t=1752432594","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3156550?t=1752432594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/df8524ed5ee548d87b62ae8788411c9e45c9de55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752432594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/df8524ed5ee548d87b62ae8788411c9e45c9de55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752432594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garden and a Goat places you out in the multiverse where you are needed most. Your robot-self is introduced to one of a series of ecosystems in peril. Study the surroundings, clean up the environment, and revive the soil and plants to start enticing the local wildlife to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garden and a Goat is a single player casual, animal collecting and gardening game. In each ecosystem you encounter you'll spend time cleaning up the garden, planting various ecosystem specific plants, and attracting animals to the revived ecosystem. As animals visit, you'll interact with them in various ways (petting them, offering treats you make, placing decorations they enjoy) to unlock them as garden residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/extras/5676f5a5049eab0ffb84acc75784bc20.avif?t=1752432594\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll use your tech consoles and drones to help the garden recover. You'll scan and harvest ecobit data currency to fuel the placement of more resident plants, animals, and decorations to accelerate the progress. Once the animals begin to take up residence again, you'll also be able to seek out secret challenges that may transform or attract exciting multiverse variant animals too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/extras/5d132ab201b857d361fbb1d83bbc9718.avif?t=1752432594\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you unlock a few crops to plant and harvest, a few recipes for new treats to make at the treat console, and new decorations to both beautify your garden and further entice more animals to stay. You'll also unlock and be rewarded with cosmetic items to transform your robot, consoles, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh\u2026 and there's a goat!</p>","developers":["Contemplation Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/header.jpg?t=1752432594","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Contemplation Games, Garden and a Goat and any associated logos, are trademarks, service marks and/or registered trademarks of the Company in the United States of America and elsewhere.","linux_requirements":{"mi